Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Step,,0,0,0,,사랑니가 {\1c&H69BEFF&}갈라진다{\1c&HF8FAFC&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.15,Step,,0,0,0,,먼저 {\1c&H69BEFF&}국소 마취{\1c&HF8FAFC&}를 한다
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.85,Step,,0,0,0,,① 잇몸을 {\1c&H69BEFF&}절개{\1c&HF8FAFC&}한다
